OL,3,ASacked Ukrainian defence minister calls
OL,4,Afor presidential election
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Ukrainian defence minister
OL,7,FMykhailo Fedorov has called for wartime
OL,8,Felections, in what many see as the
OL,9,Fbiggest challenge to Volodymyr
OL,10,FZelensky's presidency since war broke
OL,11,Fout with Russia in February 2022.
OL,13,F"Democracy cannot be held hostage by
OL,14,FRussia," said Fedorov, 35, in a video
OL,15,Fposted to YouTube on Tuesday, adding
OL,16,Fthat Ukraine is fighting "precisely
OL,17,Fbecause we want to remain a free
OL,18,FEuropean state".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
