OL,3,ASacked Ukrainian defence minister calls
OL,4,Afor presidential election
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince Russia's full-scale invasion in
OL,7,F2022 Ukraine has been under martial
OL,8,Flaw, which means elections are
OL,9,Fsuspended.
OL,11,FFedorov, who did not mention Zelensky
OL,12,Fby name in the video, was unexpectedly
OL,13,Ffired from his role as defence minister
OL,14,Fin late July, just six months after his
OL,15,Fappointment.
